              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತರುವಾಯ — taruvāya — \"thereafter; after\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಯುದ್ಧದ ತರುವಾಯ ದೇಶ ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ ಬೆಳೆಯಿತು. yuddhada taruvāya dēśa nidhānavāgi beḷeyitu. After the war the country grew slowly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A written partner of ನಂತರ: ಊಟದ ತರುವಾಯ (taruvāya), after the meal."
            }
          ]
        },
