          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತರುವಾಯ (taruvāya) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3142 lists Kannada taṟu-vāy beside Tamil taṟuvāy, \"an occasion, a particular juncture, a stage\"."
