            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ತಿಂಗಳು ಊರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಕಳ್ಳತನಗಳ ಸರಣಿ ನಡೆಯಿತು. ā tiṅgaḷu ūrinalli kaḷḷatanagaḷa saraṇi naḍeyitu. That month there was a series of thefts in the town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಸರಣಿಗಳು, saraṇigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a TV or book series, and a cricket series."
            }
